# --- dependencies / build output -------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
*.exe
*.msi
*.nsis.zip
# The self-updater works beside the exe, and neither name ends in .exe, so
# neither is covered above: `WSight.exe.new` is a downloaded build waiting for
# a restart, `WSight.exe.download` is one still arriving. They live in the
# program directory, which for a dev checkout is the repository root.
*.exe.new
*.exe.download

# --- local environment (mirrors, sandbox tweaks - not part of the source) ---
.npmrc
.cargo/

# --- local verification scratch ---------------------------------------------
# Screenshots taken while checking a build, plus a config dump that contains a
# real QWeather API key. Never commit this directory.
.verify/

# --- design reference copied from another product's UI ----------------------
参考.png

# --- AI assistant workspace memory (local only) -----------------------------
.workbuddy/

# --- OS / editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
